]],"links":[["Cook County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/minnesota/cook-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Cook County has 75 years on record, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025, October to November came in at 45% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 195% of normal on the middle of the grids and May to June at 67%.</p>"}
